{"v":1,"book":"Zech","ch":4,"verses":[{"n":1,"text":"Then the angel who spoke with me returned and roused me as a man is roused from his sleep.","tok":[{"t":"Then the "},{"t":"angel","s":["H4397"],"a":[1]},{"t":" who spoke with me returned and roused me as a "},{"t":"man","s":["H0376"],"a":[5]},{"t":" is roused from his "},{"t":"sleep","s":["H8142"],"a":[8]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":2,"text":"And he said to me, What do you see? And I said, I see that there is a lampstand all of gold, with its bowl on top of it and its seven lamps upon it, with seven pipes for each of the lamps on top of it;","tok":[{"t":"And he "},{"t":"said","s":["H0559"],"a":[0]},{"t":" to me, What do you see? And I "},{"t":"said","s":["H0559"],"a":[5]},{"t":", I see that there is a lampstand all of "},{"t":"gold","s":["H2091"],"a":[9]},{"t":", with its "},{"t":"bowl","s":["H1531"]},{"t":" on "},{"t":"top","s":["H7218"],"a":[13]},{"t":" of it and its "},{"t":"seven","s":["H7651"],"a":[14]},{"t":" "},{"t":"lamps","s":["H5216"],"a":[15]},{"t":" upon it, with "},{"t":"seven","s":["H7651"],"a":[17]},{"t":" "},{"t":"pipes","s":["H4166"],"a":[19]},{"t":" for "},{"t":"each","s":["H7651"],"a":[18]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"lamps","s":["H5216"],"a":[20]},{"t":" on "},{"t":"top","s":["H7218"],"a":[23]},{"t":" of it;"}]},{"n":3,"text":"And there are two olive trees beside it, one to the right of the bowl and one to the left.","tok":[{"t":"And there are "},{"t":"two","s":["H8147"],"a":[0]},{"t":" olive "},{"t":"trees","s":["H2132"],"a":[1]},{"t":" beside it, "},{"t":"one","s":["H0259"],"a":[3]},{"t":" to the "},{"t":"right","s":["H3225"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"bowl","s":["H1543"],"a":[5]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"one","s":["H0259"],"a":[6]},{"t":" to the "},{"t":"left","s":["H8040"],"a":[8]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":4,"text":"And I answered and spoke to the angel who spoke with me, saying, What are these, sir?","tok":[{"t":"And I "},{"t":"answered","s":["H6030"],"a":[0]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"spoke","s":["H0559"],"a":[1]},{"t":" to the "},{"t":"angel","s":["H4397"],"a":[3]},{"t":" who spoke with me, "},{"t":"saying","s":["H0559"],"a":[6]},{"t":", What are these, sir?"}]},{"n":5,"text":"And the angel who spoke with me answered and said to me, Do you not know what these are? And I said, No, sir.","tok":[{"t":"And the "},{"t":"angel","s":["H4397"],"a":[1]},{"t":" who spoke with me "},{"t":"answered","s":["H6030"],"a":[0]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"said","s":["H0559"],"a":[4]},{"t":" to me, Do you not "},{"t":"know","s":["H3045"],"a":[7]},{"t":" what these are? And I "},{"t":"said","s":["H0559"],"a":[11]},{"t":", No, sir."}]},{"n":6,"text":"And he answered and spoke to me, saying, This is the word of Jehovah to Zerubbabel, saying, Not by might nor by power, but by My Spirit, says Jehovah of hosts.","tok":[{"t":"And he "},{"t":"answered","s":["H6030"],"a":[0]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"spoke","s":["H0559"],"a":[1]},{"t":" to me, "},{"t":"saying","s":["H0559"],"a":[3]},{"t":", This is the "},{"t":"word","s":["H1697"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[6]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"Zerubbabel","s":["H2216"],"a":[8]},{"t":", "},{"t":"saying","s":["H0559"],"a":[9]},{"t":", Not by "},{"t":"might","s":["H2428"],"a":[11]},{"t":" nor by "},{"t":"power","s":["H3581"],"a":[13]},{"t":", but by My "},{"t":"Spirit","s":["H7307"],"a":[16]},{"t":", "},{"t":"says","s":["H0559"],"a":[17]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[18]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"hosts","s":["H6635"],"a":[19]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":7,"text":"Who are you, O great mountain? Before Zerubbabel you will become a plain, and he will bring forth the topstone with shouts of Grace, grace to it!","tok":[{"t":"Who are you, O "},{"t":"great","s":["H1419"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"mountain","s":["H2022"],"a":[2]},{"t":"? "},{"t":"Before","s":["H6440"],"a":[4]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Zerubbabel","s":["H2216"],"a":[5]},{"t":" you will become a "},{"t":"plain","s":["H4334"],"a":[6]},{"t":", and he will bring "},{"t":"forth","s":["H3318"],"a":[7]},{"t":" the topstone with shouts of "},{"t":"Grace","s":["H2580"],"a":[12]},{"t":", "},{"t":"grace","s":["H2580"],"a":[13]},{"t":" to it!"}]},{"n":8,"text":"Moreover the word of Jehovah came to me, saying,","tok":[{"t":"Moreover the "},{"t":"word","s":["H1697"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[2]},{"t":" came to me, "},{"t":"saying","s":["H0559"],"a":[4]},{"t":","}]},{"n":9,"text":"The hands of Zerubbabel have laid the foundation of this house, and his hands will finish it; and you will know that Jehovah of hosts has sent Me to you.","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"hands","s":["H3027"],"a":[0]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Zerubbabel","s":["H2216"],"a":[1]},{"t":" have laid the "},{"t":"foundation","s":["H3245"],"a":[2]},{"t":" of this "},{"t":"house","s":["H1004"],"a":[3]},{"t":", and his "},{"t":"hands","s":["H3027"],"a":[5]},{"t":" will "},{"t":"finish","s":["H1214"],"a":[6]},{"t":" it; and you will "},{"t":"know","s":["H3045"],"a":[7]},{"t":" that "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[9]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"hosts","s":["H6635"],"a":[10]},{"t":" has "},{"t":"sent","s":["H7971"],"a":[11]},{"t":" Me to you."}]},{"n":10,"text":"For who has despised the day of small things? For these seven rejoice when they see the plummet in the hand of Zerubbabel; they are the eyes of Jehovah running to and fro on the whole earth.","tok":[{"t":"For who has "},{"t":"despised","s":["H0936"],"a":[2]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"day","s":["H3117"],"a":[3]},{"t":" of small "},{"t":"things","s":["H6996"],"a":[4]},{"t":"? For these "},{"t":"seven","s":["H7651"],"a":[12]},{"t":" "},{"t":"rejoice","s":["H8055"],"a":[5]},{"t":" when they "},{"t":"see","s":["H7200"],"a":[6]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"plummet","s":["H0068"],"a":[8]},{"t":" in the "},{"t":"hand","s":["H3027"],"a":[10]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Zerubbabel","s":["H2216"],"a":[11]},{"t":"; they are the "},{"t":"eyes","s":["H5869"],"a":[14]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[15]},{"t":" running to and "},{"t":"fro","s":["H7751"],"a":[17]},{"t":" on the whole "},{"t":"earth","s":["H0776"],"a":[19]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":11,"text":"Then I answered and said to him, What are these two olive trees on the right of the lampstand and on its left?","tok":[{"t":"Then I "},{"t":"answered","s":["H6030"],"a":[0]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"said","s":["H0559"],"a":[1]},{"t":" to him, What are these "},{"t":"two","s":["H8147"],"a":[4]},{"t":" olive "},{"t":"trees","s":["H2132"],"a":[5]},{"t":" on the "},{"t":"right","s":["H3225"],"a":[8]},{"t":" of the lampstand and on its "},{"t":"left","s":["H8040"],"a":[11]},{"t":"?"}]},{"n":12,"text":"And I answered a second time and said to him, What are the two olive branches that are by the side of the two golden spouts, which empty the gold from themselves?","tok":[{"t":"And I "},{"t":"answered","s":["H6030"],"a":[0]},{"t":" a second time and "},{"t":"said","s":["H0559"],"a":[2]},{"t":" to him, What are the "},{"t":"two","s":["H8147"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"olive","s":["H2132"],"a":[7]},{"t":" "},{"t":"branches","s":["H7641"],"a":[6]},{"t":" that are by the side of the "},{"t":"two","s":["H8147"],"a":[10]},{"t":" "},{"t":"golden","s":["H2091"],"a":[15]},{"t":" spouts, which "},{"t":"empty","s":["H7324"],"a":[13]},{"t":" the gold from themselves?"}]},{"n":13,"text":"And he spoke to me, saying, Do you not know what these are? And I said, No, sir.","tok":[{"t":"And he spoke to me, saying, Do you not "},{"t":"know","s":["H3045"],"a":[4]},{"t":" what these are? And I "},{"t":"said","s":["H0559"],"a":[7]},{"t":", No, sir."}]},{"n":14,"text":"And he said, These are the two sons of oil, who stand by the Lord of the whole earth.","tok":[{"t":"And he "},{"t":"said","s":["H0559"],"a":[0]},{"t":", These are the "},{"t":"two","s":["H8147"],"a":[2]},{"t":" sons of oil, who "},{"t":"stand","s":["H5975"],"a":[5]},{"t":" by the "},{"t":"Lord","s":["H0113"],"a":[7]},{"t":" of the whole "},{"t":"earth","s":["H0776"],"a":[9]},{"t":"."}]}]}
